      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2023-10-11T17:47:01.216Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/anjalipv\">@anjalipv</a>,</p>\n<p>Please apply the client script for the listview.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">frappe.listview_settings['Your DocType'] = {\n\trefresh: function(listview) {\n        $('span.sidebar-toggle-btn').hide();\n        $('.col-lg-2.layout-side-section').hide();\n\t}\n};\n</code></pre>\n<p>Thank You!</p>",
